      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW ZENITH (6) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Dance Hall Days (22.93) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to his credit. Expected to feature in the finish again. OLIVER KELTON (8) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth at this track, but was among the placings at this track three back. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. BILLY RAY MIKADO (1) struggled for best form latest, finishing 8th (19.91) in a Grade 5 FIN at Healesville. Is yet to taste defeat in two starts this course and distance. Worth another chance. DR. LOUIS (7) is another with top-three prospects.",
